// A person is made of `Creature`, and so of `sprout.Actor`, whose guards
// make their things their own: nobody else carries them off
// (`held_fast`), nobody else takes from their hands (`not_yours`), and
// they hold only what fits (`hands_full`). The world keeps the library's
// first two lines and says the third in its own words.
kind Creature is sprout.Actor {
  :capacity 2
  passage hands_full { {self} has both hands full already. }
}
